<body>
<main>
<h1 id="links">Links</h1>
<p>Every link form in one note.</p>
<ul>
<li>Label: <a href="/people/Jane%20Doe">Jane</a></li>
<li>Heading: <a href="/welcome#a-table">welcome#A table</a></li>
<li>Relative: <a href="/people/Jane%20Doe">../people/Jane Doe</a></li>
<li>Root: <a href="/people/Jane%20Doe">People/jane doe</a></li>
<li>Bare name: <a href="/people/Jane%20Doe">jane doe</a></li>
<li>Within the page: <a href="#links">#Links</a></li>
<li>Html page: <a href="/maps/route.html">route.html</a></li>
<li>Image: <a href="/img/dot.png">dot.png</a></li>
<li>Markdown: <a href="/people/Jane%20Doe">Jane</a>, <a href="/welcome#a-table">table</a> and <a href="https://example.com">example</a></li>
<li>Broken: <a class="broken-link">nobody</a> and <a class="broken-link">gone</a></li>
<li>Embed: <a href="/welcome">welcome</a></li>
</ul>
</main>
